+## Label-block fixed-window integration control
+
+The files label_block_qrom_backend.py and test_label_block_qrom_backend.py
+provide a finite deterministic integration control for a coherent address/sign
+label-block selector. The control is intentionally not a scalable resource
+claim and is kept separate from the existing Fig.14 arithmetic estimates.
